@base = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Listar (los 2 libros de la semilla)
GET {{base}}/books

### 2. Detalle
GET {{base}}/books/1

### 3. Inexistente (404 BOOK_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{base}}/books/999

### 4. Body incompleto (400 con details de Zod)
POST {{base}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": ""
}

### 5. Válido sin ISBN (201, stock: 0)
POST {{base}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Rayuela",
  "author": "Julio Cortázar"
}

### 6. Válido con ISBN (201)
POST {{base}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ficciones",
  "author": "Jorge Luis Borges",
  "isbn": "9788420633114",
  "stock": 2
}

### 7. Mismo ISBN (409 ISBN_DUPLICATE)
POST {{base}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ficciones (otra edición)",
  "author": "Jorge Luis Borges",
  "isbn": "9788420633114"
}

### 8. Actualizar solo stock (200, title intacto)
PUT {{base}}/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stock": 10
}

### Desafío 1: stock negativo (400 — lo frena Zod antes de llegar al caso de uso)
PUT {{base}}/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stock": -1
}

### 9. Borrar (204)
DELETE {{base}}/books/1

### 10. Borrar de nuevo (404)
DELETE {{base}}/books/1

### Ruta inexistente (404 ROUTE_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{base}}/cualquier-cosa
